## 1. Modular Reduction (mod_reduce)

Standard for operands in [0, 2q). Ports: input [{{dw}}:0] val, output [{{dw_minus_1}}:0] out.
Logic: if val >= q ({{dw}}'d{{q}}), out = val - q; else out = val. Combinational.

